The SVG files in this directory are brand marks from Simple Icons
(https://simpleicons.org), published there under CC0 1.0 (public domain).
Each is named by the manager that shows it, not by the brand that drew it:
pip.svg is Python's mark, cargo.svg is Rust's, and uvtool.svg is uv's.

The set is not complete. A manager without a file here shows without a
mark; add one named by the manager's ID to give it its own.
